WEBVTT

00:07:59.978 --> 00:08:04.375
But when I looked, all were men,

00:08:04.375 --> 00:08:06.797
and I picked my pen,

00:08:06.797 --> 00:08:08.801
drew a line from my name,

00:08:08.801 --> 00:08:12.500
and wrote, "Malala."

00:08:13.585 --> 00:08:16.355
And when she grow old,

00:08:16.355 --> 00:08:19.938
when she was four and a half years old,

00:08:19.938 --> 00:08:23.474
I admitted her in my school.

00:08:23.474 --> 00:08:26.380
You will be asking, then, why should I mention about

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:28.882
the admission of a girl in a school?

00:08:28.882 --> 00:08:30.937
Yes, I must mention it.